 "ratioMeaning": "column differential / native differential, same language version and compiler family (lower is better; 1.00 = no overhead over native)",
 "spreadMeaning": "maxSpreadPct: largest (max - min) / median of I(n1) or I(n2) over the runs, percent (lower is better; 0 = bit-exact)",
